{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>赤鱲角有車起火。今日（29日）凌晨0時43分，消防接報指，一輛私家車沿順朗路往機場方向行駛，其間冒煙起火，司機察覺後，立即將車停泊路旁並自行脫困逃生，消防員接報趕至開喉灌救，同日凌晨1時05分將火撲熄，初步相信引擎過熱肇禍。事件中，無人受傷。</p><p>有目擊者在網上表示，「坐緊Uber，返屋企途中，見到對面線架白色（豐田）Alphard車頭起火」、「消防車啱啱到」。</p><figure><img alt=\"私家車冒煙起火。（Threads@domjai影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261129/1203519125129793536938075.jpeg/Fpdpahdnp3u4IekBc1Z8AvvDFjR_R4d23S7ISt0uyEo\"/><figcaption>私家車冒煙起火。（Threads@domjai影片截圖）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T17:42:22.118994+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":209,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T17:26:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T17:35:52.485933+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T17:35:52.485933+00:00","content_hash":"5a975ec92e2e8e2710d2b30c1e266aa99bcd8bed76fe00ef1fc94d55731ea653","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}